---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● MIDDLETOWN &amp; NEW CASTLE COUNTY · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>AC REPAIR<br />IN <span>MIDDLETOWN</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Fixes. Cool Comfort. Same-Day Service.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When your air conditioner fails in Middletown, Delaware heat is no joke. Our licensed technicians are on call around the clock — delivering expert AC repairs, upfront pricing, and workmanship backed by a written guarantee for every home in New Castle County.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">❄️</div>
          <h3>AC Not Cooling?</h3>
          <p>We diagnose and repair central AC, heat pumps, and ductless systems the same day in most cases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Middletown Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Delaware summers demand reliable cooling. When your AC struggles, you need a licensed local specialist who responds the same day and repairs it right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Diagnosis &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most same-day AC repair calls in Middletown are completed within hours of your call — no multi-day waits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Certified</h3>
          <p>Every technician is licensed, insured, and trained on central air, heat pumps, ductless mini-splits, and all major brands common in New Castle County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we wrench. No hidden fees, no upsell pressure — just honest AC repair at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Middletown</h3>
          <p>Based in Middletown — we know local housing, common brands (Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem), and Delaware code requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>45 min</strong><span>Avg. Response</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>97%</strong><span>First-Visit Fix Rate</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Available</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Humidity and hard use accelerate AC wear in Middletown. If your system shows any of these symptoms, don't wait.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/no-cooling/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>AC Not Cooling</h3>
          <p>Warm air from vents often means low refrigerant, compressor issues, or a failed capacitor. Same-day service restores comfort fast.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/ac-leaking/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>AC Leaking Water</h3>
          <p>Water pooling near the indoor unit signals a clogged drain line or frozen coil. Act before floor damage spreads.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/strange-noises/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Strange Noises</h3>
          <p>Grinding, squealing, or banging usually means a failing motor, belt, or loose part. Early service prevents bigger repairs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/high-energy-bills/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>High Energy Bills</h3>
          <p>Sudden spike in electric bills often points to dirty coils, low refrigerant, or an aging system working overtime.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/frozen-coils/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Frozen Coils</h3>
          <p>Ice on the outdoor or indoor unit means restricted airflow or low refrigerant. Shut it off and call before compressor damage.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/thermostat-issues/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Thermostat Issues</h3>
          <p>AC that won't turn on or cycles constantly is often a thermostat, wiring, or control board problem — usually a quick fix.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services preview -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert AC <span>Repair Services</span></h2>
        <p>Every cooling problem has a root cause. Our certified technicians diagnose accurately and repair correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Urgent Response</span>
          <h3>Emergency AC Repair</h3>
          <p>When cooling fails at the worst moment, we respond around the clock — no after-hours surcharge surprises.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Available 24 / 7</li>
            <li>Avg. response under 60 min</li>
            <li>Stocked service vehicles</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Preventive</span>
          <h3>AC Maintenance &amp; Tune-Up</h3>
          <p>Seasonal tune-ups keep efficiency high, lower bills, and catch small issues before they become expensive failures.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Coil cleaning &amp; filter check</li>
            <li>Refrigerant level check</li>
            <li>Performance verification</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-maintenance/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Replacement</span>
          <h3>AC Installation</h3>
          <p>Code-compliant central air and heat pump installs sized for Delaware homes and humidity.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Same-day installs often available</li>
            <li>Proper sizing &amp; load calc</li>
            <li>Workmanship warranty</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-installation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Modern Systems</span>
          <h3>Ductless Mini-Split</h3>
          <p>Repair and install ductless systems for additions, older homes, and room-by-room comfort control.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Brand specialists</li>
            <li>Multi-zone expertise</li>
            <li>Efficient year-round comfort</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ductless-mini-split/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Year-Round</span>
          <h3>Heat Pump Repair</h3>
          <p>Heat pumps handle both heating and cooling. We service all major brands and diagnose dual-mode issues.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Heating &amp; cooling modes</li>
            <li>Defrost cycle expertise</li>
            <li>All major brands</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/heat-pump-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Comfort</span>
          <h3>Indoor Air Quality</h3>
          <p>Filters, UV lights, humidifiers, and purifiers that improve air quality and system efficiency.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Filter upgrades</li>
            <li>UV &amp; purification</li>
            <li>Humidity control</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/air-quality/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Restore Your <span>Cool Comfort</span></h2>
        <p>Every Middletown AC repair follows a structured, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">01</div>
          <h3>Scheduling &amp; Same-Day Response</h3>
          <p>Call or text. We confirm your appointment quickly — often offering same-day slots.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">02</div>
          <h3>Precision Diagnostic</h3>
          <p>We test refrigerant, capacitors, motors, airflow, and electrical components with instruments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">03</div>
          <h3>Honest Findings &amp; Options</h3>
          <p>Before any work begins, your technician explains findings in plain language with a written estimate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">04</div>
          <h3>Skilled Repair</h3>
          <p>With your approval, repair begins. Service vehicles carry common parts so most jobs finish first visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">05</div>
          <h3>Performance Check</h3>
          <p>We verify cooling output, check for leaks, confirm thermostat response, and leave a summary.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Location -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="location">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Find Us in <span>Middletown, DE</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Middletown and all of New Castle County from Industrial Drive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-section">
        <div class="map-info">
          <h3>📍 11105 Industrial Dr #6, Middletown, DE 19709</h3>
          <p>Serving Middletown · Odessa · Townsend · Smyrna · Dover · Bear · Newark · Wilmington and surrounding communities.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem"><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary)">{phoneDisplay}</a></p>
          <p><strong>Hours:</strong> Open 24 / 7 for emergency AC repair</p>
        </div>
        <div class="map-embed">
          <iframe
            title="AC Repair Middletown DE location"
            src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-75.74%2C39.43%2C-75.69%2C39.47&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=39.4493%2C-75.7163"
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-banner">
        <h2>AC Down in Middletown?</h2>
        <p>Don't suffer through the heat. If your system stopped cooling, is leaking, or is making unusual sounds — our team can respond today.</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.1rem;padding:1rem 2rem">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>AC Repair <span>Questions</span></h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Middletown homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>My AC stopped cooling — is this an emergency?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes, especially during Delaware heat waves or with elderly residents, infants, or medical needs. Most complete failures trace to a failed capacitor, low refrigerant, or tripped breaker. Emergency calls placed earlier in the day are typically completed same-day.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How much does AC repair cost in Middletown?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Simple fixes (capacitor, contactor, thermostat) often range from a few hundred dollars. We provide a written estimate before any work begins. Replacement is recommended when the unit is old and repair exceeds roughly 50% of replacement cost.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Do you repair both central AC and heat pumps?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes. We service central air conditioners, heat pumps, ductless mini-splits, and package units from all major brands including Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem, York, and more.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Are you licensed and insured in Delaware?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured technicians familiar with Delaware mechanical codes and local requirements for Middletown and New Castle County.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Should I repair or replace my AC?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Repair usually makes sense if the unit is under 10–12 years old and the issue is isolated. Replacement is worth evaluating for units 12+ years old, recurring failures, or when repair cost approaches half the value of a new system. We give an honest assessment either way.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
